{'review': '<<<ARTIFACT review_report>>>\n{\n  "overall_status": "NEEDS_FIXES",\n  "quality_score": 6.5,\n  "summary": {\n    "critical": 0,\n    "high": 0,\n    "medium": 3,\n    "low": 3,\n    "passed_checks": [\n      "No hardcoded secrets",\n      "Parameterized queries (EF Core) prevents SQL injection",\n      "Proper disposal of DbContext via using statement",\n      "Correct use of TypedResults for HTTP responses",\n      "Route names match for CreatedAtRoute",\n      "UTC timestamps used consistently"\n    ]\n  },\n  "findings": [\n    {\n      "finding_id": "F-001",\n      "severity": "medium",\n      "category": "performance",\n      "title": "Missing AsNoTracking for read‑only GET list",\n      "file": "src/Api/Features/Todos/TodoEndpoints.cs",\n      "line_range": [18, 22],\n      "description": "The GET /api/v1/todos query tracks entities unnecessarily, causing extra overhead for a read‑only operation.",\n      "impact": "Slightly reduced performance and increased memory usage when returning many todos.",\n      "suggested_fix": "Add AsNoTracking() before filtering/ordering.",\n      "code_before": "            var query = dbContext.Todos.AsQueryable();\\n\\n            if (completed.HasValue)\\n            {\\n                query = query.Where(t => t.Completed == completed.Value);\\n            }\\n\\n            var todos = await query\\n                .OrderBy(t => t.CreatedAt)\\n                .Select(t => new TodoResponse(t.Id, t.Title, t.Description, t.Completed, t.CreatedAt, t.UpdatedAt))\\n                .ToListAsync();",\n      "code_after": "            var query = dbContext.Todos.AsNoTracking().AsQueryable();\\n\\n            if (completed.HasValue)\\n            {\\n                query = query.Where(t => t.Completed == completed.Value);\\n            }\\n\\n            var todos = await query\\n                .OrderBy(t => t.CreatedAt)\\n                .Select(t => new TodoResponse(t.Id, t.Title, t.Description, t.Completed, t.CreatedAt, t.UpdatedAt))\\n                .ToListAsync();"\n    },\n    {\n      "finding_id": "F-002",\n      "severity": "medium",\n      "category": "quality",\n      "title": "Missing optimistic concurrency handling in UpdateTodo",\n      "file": "src/Api/Features/Todos/TodoEndpoints.cs",\n      "line_range": [68, 86],\n      "description": "The Update endpoint reads an entity, modifies it, and saves changes without checking for concurrent updates, which can lead to lost updates.",\n      "impact": "Two simultaneous updates may overwrite each other\'s changes silently.",\n      "suggested_fix": "Add a concurrency token (e.g., RowVersion) to the Todo entity and check it during SaveChanges, or handle DbUpdateConcurrencyException.",\n      "code_before": "            todo.Title = request.Title ?? todo.Title;\\n            todo.Description = request.Description ?? todo.Description;\\n            todo.Completed = request.Completed ?? todo.Completed;\\n            todo.UpdatedAt = DateTimeOffset.UtcNow;\\n\\n            await dbContext.SaveChangesAsync();",\n      "code_after": "            todo.Title = request.Title ?? todo.Title;\\n            todo.Description = request.Description ?? todo.Description;\\n            todo.Completed = request.Completed ?? todo.Completed;\\n            todo.UpdatedAt = DateTimeOffset.UtcNow;\\n\\n            try\\n            {\\n                await dbContext.SaveChangesAsync();\\n            }\\n            catch (DbUpdateConcurrencyException)\\n            {\\n                // Log and return conflict\\n                return TypedResults.Conflict();\\n            }"\n    },\n    {\n      "finding_id": "F-003",\n      "severity": "medium",\n      "category": "performance",\n      "title": "Missing pagination on GET list endpoint",\n      "file": "src/Api/Features/Todos/TodoEndpoints.cs",\n      "line_range": [14, 30],\n      "description": "The GET /api/v1/todos endpoint returns all matching todos without limit, which could cause large payloads and high memory usage.",\n      "impact": "Potential denial‑of‑service or slow responses when the todo collection grows large.",\n      "suggested_fix": "Add optional pageSize and pageNumber parameters and apply Skip/Take to the query.",\n      "code_before": "        todosApi.MapGet(\\"/\\", async (\\n            IDbContextFactory<AppDbContext> dbContextFactory,\\n            bool? completed = null) =>\\n        {\\n            using var dbContext = dbContextFactory.CreateDbContext();\\n            var query = dbContext.Todos.AsQueryable();\\n\\n            if (completed.HasValue)\\n            {\\n                query = query.Where(t => t.Completed == completed.Value);\\n            }\\n\\n            var todos = await query\\n                .OrderBy(t => t.CreatedAt)\\n                .Select(t => new TodoResponse(t.Id, t.Title, t.Description, t.Completed, t.CreatedAt, t.UpdatedAt))\\n                .ToListAsync();\\n\\n            return TypedResults.Ok(todos);\\n        })",\n      "code_after": "        todosApi.MapGet(\\"/\\", async (\\n            IDbContextFactory<AppDbContext> dbContextFactory,\\n            bool? completed = null,\\n            int pageNumber = 1,\\n            int pageSize = 20) =>\\n        {\\n            using var dbContext = dbContextFactory.CreateDbContext();\\n            var query = dbContext.Todos.AsNoTracking().AsQueryable();\\n\\n            if (completed.HasValue)\\n            {\\n                query = query.Where(t => t.Completed == completed.Value);\\n            }\\n\\n            var todos = await query\\n                .OrderBy(t => t.CreatedAt)\\n                .Skip((pageNumber - 1) * pageSize)\\n                .Take(pageSize)\\n                .Select(t => new TodoResponse(t.Id, t.Title, t.Description, t.Completed, t.CreatedAt, t.UpdatedAt))\\n                .ToListAsync();\\n\\n            return TypedResults.Ok(todos);\\n        })"\n    },\n    {\n      "finding_id": "F-004",\n      "severity": "low",\n      "category": "quality",\n      "title": "Missing explicit validation on request models",\n      "file": "src/Api/Features/Todos/TodoEndpoints.cs",\n      "line_range": [44, 66],\n      "description": "The CreateTodo and UpdateTodo endpoints rely on model binding but do not enforce validation rules (e.g., required Title, length limits).",\n      "impact": "Invalid data (empty titles, overly long strings) could be persisted, leading to data quality issues.",\n      "suggested_fix": "Add data annotation attributes to CreateTodoRequest and UpdateTodoRequest (e.g., [Required], [StringLength]) and validate ModelState or use FluentValidation.",\n      "code_before": "    public record CreateTodoRequest(string Title, string? Description, bool Completed);\\n    public record UpdateTodoRequest(string? Title, string? Description, bool? Completed);",\n      "code_after": "    public record CreateTodoRequest(\\n        [Required][StringLength(200)] string Title,\\n        [StringLength(2000)] string? Description,\\n        bool Completed);\\n    public record UpdateTodoRequest(\\n        [StringLength(200)] string? Title,\\n        [StringLength(2000)] string? Description,\\n        bool? Completed);"\n    },\n    {\n      "finding_id": "F-005",\n      "severity": "low",\n      "category": "quality",\n      "title": "Missing logging of unhandled exceptions",\n      "file": "src/Api/Features/Todos/TodoEndpoints.cs",\n      "line_range": [14, 106],\n      "description": "No try/catch or logging infrastructure is present; unexpected EF Core exceptions will bubble up as 500 responses without diagnostic information.",\n      "impact": "Difficult to diagnose production issues; operators lack visibility into failures.",\n      "suggested_fix": "Inject ILogger<TodoEndpoints> and log exceptions before returning a 500, or use a global exception handling middleware.",\n      "code_before": "        // (example from GET list)\\n        using var dbContext = dbContextFactory.CreateDbContext();\\n        var query = dbContext.Todos.AsQueryable();\\n        // ...\\n        var todos = await query ... .ToListAsync();\\n        return TypedResults.Ok(todos);",\n      "code_after": "        private static readonly ILogger _logger = LoggerFactory.Create(builder => builder.AddConsole()).CreateLogger<TodoEndpoints>;\\n        // ...\\n        try\\n        {\\n            using var dbContext = dbContextFactory.CreateDbContext();\\n            var query = dbContext.Todos.AsNoTracking().AsQueryable();\\n            // ...\\n            var todos = await query ... .ToListAsync();\\n            return TypedResults.Ok(todos);\\n        }\\n        catch (Exception ex)\\n        {\\n            _logger.Error(ex, \\"Error processing todo request\\");\\n            return TypedResults.StatusCode(StatusCodes.Status500InternalServerError);\\n        }"\n    },\n    {\n      "finding_id": "F-006",\n      "severity": "low",\n      "category": "security",\n      "title": "Missing authentication/authorization on endpoints",\n      "file": "src/Api/Features/Todos/TodoEndpoints.cs",\n      "line_range": [14, 106],\n      "description": "All todo endpoints are publicly accessible; no authentication or authorization checks are applied.",\n      "impact": "Unauthenticated users could create, read, update, or delete todos, which may be undesirable depending on business requirements.",\n      "suggested_fix": "Apply authentication schemes (e.g., JWT) and authorization policies via .RequireAuthorization() or scoped to specific roles/policies.",\n      "code_before": "        var todosApi = app.MapGroup(\\"/api/v1/todos\\")\\n            .WithTags(\\"Todos\\");",\n      "code_after": "        var todosApi = app.MapGroup(\\"/api/v1/todos\\")\\n            .WithTags(\\"Todos\\")\\n            .RequireAuthorization(); // or specific policy"\n    }\n  ],\n  "positive_observations": [\n    "Uses IDbContextFactory for proper DbContext lifecycle management",\n    "All async operations correctly awaited",\n    "Route names are consistent and used correctly in CreatedAtRoute",\n    "UTC timestamps used for audit fields",\n    "Partial update pattern with null coalescing prevents over‑writing with null unintentionally",\n    "OpenAPI documentation generated via WithOpenApi() on each endpoint"\n  ]\n}\n<<<ENDARTIFACT>>>\n```'}